@host = http://localhost:8001

### Create an order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "cust-1",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "ABC", "quantity": 2, "unit_price": "10.50" },
    { "sku": "XYZ", "quantity": 1, "unit_price": "5.00" }
  ]
}

### Get an order (paste an order_id from the response above)
GET {{host}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000